{"slug":"The-Chosen-One-Command-Line-209565","_id":"69f2e06455c041bb2f7c58f2","title":"Command Line","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77f79","gameId":11137575513,"name":"The Chosen One","imageUrl":"/images/sb/rbx-f45f818a6202169c9987b2e9a5bcbfe9-b2bc9c374079.png","placeId":11137575513},"features":"DISCORD SERVER: https://discord.gg/G7kaFZJcVW\n\nScript is Open-Source, meaning exploiters can skid the code (although you have to credit me/anyone else who contributed to whatever you're skidding) Open-Source also means that you can check the code itself if it is safe, there is nothing malicious in this script.\n\nThe script also has support for OG servers. Some features aren't possible for OG though.\n\nThis is one of the most powerful and useful scripts in TCO! It had been kept private because back then the code had been too overpowered, but because pealz leaked everything I have decided to make this public.\n\nAnchor/Unanchor Aura\nBlock/Sign Aura (spams blocks/signs around a player)\nDecal Tool (uses memeify to create a \"decal\" on a block)\nRotate Tool (rotates blocks)\nEditor Tool (adds properties and functions to blocks for minigames)\nDisable Building\nRestore Brick (restores a brick if building is disabled)\nFix Brick (fixes bricks if they are bugged/spammed with spray)\nFix Cam (fixes camera)\nFling/Nanfling (flings player)\nFloat (uses character to act as a platform for a player)\nFly/Unfly/ToggleFly (changes whether flying is enabled for you)\nDisable Delete Sound/Permanently Disable Delete Sound\nRainbow Aura (makes nearby blocks rainbow)\nRank/Whitelist (hand off your admin powers to another player)\nStash/Unstash/Tostash (makes a stash for enlighten)\nTospawn (teleports you to spawn)\nDelete Aura (deletes blocks near you)","tags":["op","commands","whitelist","griefing","rotool"],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/1AreYouMental110/TCO-Command-Line/refs/heads/main/Command%20Line.lua\"))()","owner":{"_id":"66d682a10a9db34a5